Vendored from yt-dlp-ejs 0.8.0 (https://github.com/yt-dlp/ejs), Unlicense.

core.min.js is unmodified.

lib.min.js differs from upstream in one mechanical way: its 2169 non-ASCII
characters (an HTML named-entity table inside string literals) are rewritten as
\uXXXX escapes, so the repo stays ASCII-only. The JS meaning is unchanged.
